---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="For Developers — PhuketPropertyPartners"
  description="Give your clients a solution after purchase too. Fixed rent program for approved units, no fee for partner developers."
  canonicalPath="/en/for-developers/"
  alternates={{ cs: '/pro-developery/', en: '/en/for-developers/', de: '/de/for-developers/', ru: '/ru/for-developers/' }}
>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="brand">PhuketPropertyPartners</div>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="/en/">Home</a>
      <a href="/en/for-owners/">For Owners</a>
      <a href="/en/for-developers/">For Developers</a>
      <a href="/en/for-agencies/">For Agencies</a>
      <a href="/pro-developery/" class="lang-switch">CZ</a>
      <a href="/de/for-developers/" class="lang-switch">DE</a>
      <a href="/ru/for-developers/" class="lang-switch">RU</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="eyebrow">For Developers</div>
  <h1 class="serif">Give clients a solution<br>after purchase too.</h1>
  <p>Foreign investors always ask what happens to the property next. Our fixed rent program gives approved units a clear answer — without you having to build your own rental team.</p>
</section>

<section class="section" id="what-we-offer">
  <div class="head">
    <div class="eyebrow">What we offer</div>
    <h2 class="serif">Partnership with no upfront fee</h2>
  </div>
  <ul class="list-plain">
    <li>Fixed rent program for approved units</li>
    <li>No upfront fee for partner developers</li>
    <li>Access to foreign investors — Europe, UK, and other markets</li>
    <li>Investment calculations and joint marketing materials</li>
    <li>Complete post-sale solution — we take over management and rental</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="process" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="step">
    <div class="num">01</div>
    <h3 class="serif">You send info</h3>
    <p>About the project and available units — types, prices, construction timeline.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step">
    <div class="num">02</div>
    <h3 class="serif">We evaluate</h3>
    <p>The project and individual unit types from a rental-potential standpoint.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step">
    <div class="num">03</div>
    <h3 class="serif">We approve terms</h3>
    <p>For suitable units, a specific fixed rent amount and program length.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="step">
    <div class="num">04</div>
    <h3 class="serif">We take over</h3>
    <p>After handover to the client, we manage the agreed operations and rental.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="why-us">
  <div class="head">
    <div class="eyebrow">Why work with us</div>
    <h2 class="serif">A stronger sales argument</h2>
    <p>The client enters a rental contract directly with the approved owner and our operating company — the developer carries no rental guarantee unless explicitly agreed otherwise.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer id="contact">
  <div class="contact">
    <span><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@ownphuket.com">info@ownphuket.com</a></span>
    <span><strong>Thailand:</strong> <a href="tel:+66640560006">+66 640 560 006</a></span>
    <span><strong>Europe:</strong> <a href="tel:+420604253824">+420 604 253 824</a></span>
  </div>
  <div class="legal">
    <strong>PhuketPropertyPartners</strong> arranges the management and rental of properties in Phuket.
    Cooperation terms, rent amount and program length are always governed by an individual contract between
    the property owner and the program operator.
  </div>
</footer>

</BaseLayout>
